y of mental health conditions. Our mission is to help people lead healthier, more fulfilling lives by improving access to trusted, affordable, and personalized mental healthcare. LifeStance and its supported practices employ over 8,500 psychiatrists, advanced practice nurses, psychologists and therapists and operates across 33 states and more than 550 centers. To learn more, please visit www.LifeStance.com.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1845257/000119312526336057/lfst-ex99_1.htm","filed":"2026-08-06","source":"8-K"}}